            "body": "Thanks for reminding  me to set custom_text object to false to configure the blacklist!\r\n\r\n> If you execute `yi\"`, it shows message `Textobject region is empty. Nothing is done.`. This is because when cursor is on `world`, it tries to copy **inside** the following `\"\"` (which is the the next match here, as quotes are balanced). This is expected.\r\n\r\nI got your point, thanks for mentioning that.",
